Section: sound
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Pulsar Maintainers <maintainers@example.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/skomesh/pulsar
Description: Graphical PulseAudio/PipeWire routing manager
 Pulsar is a Tkinter GUI around pactl for inspecting and routing audio
 streams between sinks and sources. It offers per-application volume and
 mute control, stream routing, sink/source selection, and reusable
 profiles (presets).
 .
 Starter profiles ship read-only inside the package. Profiles you create
 are stored per user under $XDG_DATA_HOME/pulsar (normally
 ~/.local/share/pulsar) and are never touched by installing, upgrading or
 removing this package.